{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring turn-based command battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 allied characters with different effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 2,500 diverse skills! (Including enemy skills)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely customize your character with a wide variety of weapons, armor, and accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the combination, various battles can be realized!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/b78a8821ba0e7ce40ab9c143fa4748d7.avif?t=1755855177\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle according to your play style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character's role is displayed, allowing you to see their characteristics at a glance. It's up to you whether you go with your favorite character, find a combination that works well together, or go all-attacker. If you're lucky, you can even defeat a powerful boss in one hit. (The term &quot;boss&quot; is obsolete now...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/de8faab30766aa73d16041b9adedbf58.avif?t=1755855177\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your strongest special skills!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters have special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They range from sweeping attacks to supporting allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge SP (Special Points) to unleash special skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-level SP+ skills also exist, and all characters can learn them by leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate everything from enemies to bosses with these incredibly powerful SP+ skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/7c14ab7eca0d52abf0a388a5e69aa66f.avif?t=1755855177\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the best treasures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are rare drops from monsters and hidden treasure chests, and almost all monsters drop powerful equipment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase the difficulty level to increase the drop rate, so if you're confident in your skills, be sure to give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/extras/2ca08437709cc35690b0b48927cf2e47.avif?t=1755855177\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902670?t=1755855177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/cfbca50fd43e0f87275b235cdb6b08edcfb7e44f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755855177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/c72f913bd80f0328b8976c597e3842d0c0b874a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755855177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902670/c72f913bd80f0328b8976c597e3842d0c0b874a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755855177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring turn-based command 